{"ref":"BDB, אֲחִיעֶ֫זֶר","hw":"אֲחִיעֶ֫זֶר","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">אֲחִיעֶ֫זֶר</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m. (</strong><em>my brother is help</em>, cf. Assyrian <em>Aḫulêʾte</em>, <em>my brother is strength</em>, Dl<sup>Pr 202</sup><strong>) </strong><br><strong>1.</strong>  a chief of Dan <a data-ref=\"Numbers 1:12\" href=\"/Numbers.1.12\">Nu 1:12</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 2:25\" href=\"/Numbers.2.25\">2:25</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 7:66\" href=\"/Numbers.7.66\">7:66</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 7:71\" href=\"/Numbers.7.71\">71</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 10:25\" href=\"/Numbers.10.25\">10:25</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  one of David’s heroes <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 12:3\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.12.3\">1 Ch 12:3</a>.","next":"BDB, אֲחִיקָם","prev":"BDB, אֲחִיסָמָךְ"}